WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:34.980
We’ve finally arrived at our final battle site: Doma's Temple.

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:40.600
For 10,000 years, human souls were sealed there.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:44.620
Partner, Jonouchi, everyone...

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:50.220
We will stop Dartz’s plan and liberate your souls!

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:55.530
Kaiba, in this duel, let's give it our all from the start!

00:01:55.530 --> 00:02:01.530
Tragedy Of Atlantis

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:13.910
Atlantis - the sacred city of water.

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:17.580
Atlantis was a wonderful city.

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:23.340
Long before I became king, people worked with the spirits of this land.

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:28.090
Together, they built a fruitful city that was in harmony with nature.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:35.500
They lived simple, satisfied lives without greed.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:38.250
However, one day...

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:46.720
A giant black dragon emerged from the ground and swallowed the sun.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:56.220
And the Orichalcos was created.

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:58.080
The Orichalcos…

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:01.660
An unknown substance that eruped from the earth.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:06.750
The planet gave us the Orichalcos as a gift.

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:10.840
That's what everyone thought at first.

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:19.850
Because it was a miraculous substance that could be used for energy, medicine, industry, everything.

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:26.200
By the time I became king, Atlantis was an advanced civilization.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:32.720
But neither I nor my father Ironheart realized...

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:38.230
That the people's hearts were beginning to rot, slowly and quietly.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:41.230
Ironheart and you are father and son?

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:45.170
The Orichalcos rotted people’s hearts?

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:46.660
Yes.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:54.180
An environment that easily fulfills greed breeds darkness in the heart.

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:57.180
It's similar to today's society.

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:59.580
The world is materialistic.

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:04.990
In exchange for convenience, people have forgotten the blessings of the spirits and the land.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:11.860
Humans have lost the creativity to see the truth and feel emotions.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:16.570
Humans are the cruelest creatures on Earth.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:24.010
The constant fighting led to an unexpected disaster.

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.190
Iore, what’s wrong?

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:44.800
Iore!

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:26.620
Why did this happen?

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:11.360
I understood everything.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:15.250
The Orichalcos was no miraculous substance.

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:23.070
It infiltrated and amplified the darkness in people's hearts to create a new life form.

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:31.140
The Orichalcos is a cursed substance created by this planet to test humans.

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:33.070
Test humans?

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:38.120
The darkness in your own heart destroys you.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:42.020
That's what the Orichalcos does.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:44.950
Dartz!  Get rid of the Orichalcos!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:48.720
Our civilization will regress, but that's fine.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:54.460
Dartz, we must go back to living simple lives with the spirits, like old times!

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:57.470
It’s too late, Father.

00:06:57.470 --> 00:07:02.380
Even if I get rid of the Orichalcos, the people can't return to normal.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:03.410
Dartz...

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:06.410
Father, I've realized something.

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:10.700
I've heard the voice of this planet inside the Orichalcos.

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:11.640
What?

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:20.130
Why are humans the only species that was granted knowledge and creativity?

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:26.060
Because we're meant to be this planet's guardians.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:31.860
The Earth tested humans with the Orichalcos, and we failed.

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:35.370
So the Earth has given me a task.

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:40.600
To call forth the god of Orichalcos and destroy rotten humans…

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:44.840
…and create new humans.

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:49.050
And I've been given the power to achieve it.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.880
Father, what are they?

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:11.800
I need many souls to call forth the god of Orichalcos.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:14.260
Have you gone mad, Dartz?

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:40.430
With the ancient ritual of the spirits, I will bring a new god to our planet!

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:07.260
The spirits have worked with us since long ago, so they will help us.

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:25.500
This connects to the spirit world!

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:30.680
Spirits, give us power!

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:48.040
My foolish father received help from the spirit world - the world you call Duel Monsters.

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:50.940
He challenged me.  And perished.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:03.410
That’s the battle at the Rock Wasteland.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:08.080
Before he died, my father sealed the portal to the spirit world.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:13.300
The souls of the spirits left behind were scattered all over the world.

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:19.540
I've been waiting for 10,000 long years.

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:24.970
But the world is corrupt once again, and humans keep making mistakes.

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:29.640
I've decided to bring back the god of Orichalcos.

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:34.680
To destroy this world and the Duel Monsters world.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:41.690
But due to Dragon Master Knight’s attack, you've already lost.

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:44.690
Seto and Nameless Pharaoh.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:48.580
Now feel my power.

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.600
Yugi!

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:03.530
Big brother!

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.810
No way!  Dartz didn’t lose life points!

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.820
It’s Orichalcos Kyutora’s effect.

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:17.500
It reduces battle damage between monsters to 0.

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:23.330
No way...  Even with my brother and Yugi's strongest attack...

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:25.400
He took no damage?

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:28.900
Revive, Orichalcos Gigas!

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:30.720
Be careful, Kaiba.

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:34.590
That monster gains attack points every time it revives.

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:40.570
Nameless Pharaoh and Seto, it's pointless.

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:43.510
You can't defeat me.

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:45.420
My turn.

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:52.290
Due to Orichalcos Gigas's effect, I'm not allowed to draw a new card.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:55.520
But I'll activate this card from my hand.

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:58.530
The second power born from darkness!

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:01.800
Orichalcos Deuteros!

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:08.260
What is this?

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:11.170
A second Seal of Orichalcos?

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:52.550
This is...

00:12:52.550 --> 00:12:55.480
A second Seal of Orichalcos!

00:12:58.430 --> 00:13:00.420
A second Seal?

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:04.940
Due to Orichalcos Deuteros's effect...

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:11.950
...during my turn, I regain 500 life points for every monster on my field.

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:14.670
There are two monsters on my field.

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:17.880
So I regain 1000 life points.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.810
That Seal restores life points.

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:27.180
Orichalcos Gigas, attack Dragon Master Knight!

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:31.740
What?  He's attacking with a monster that has 1400 attack points.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:35.190
But Dragon Master Knight has 5000 attack points.

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:39.130
Go, Orichalcos Gigas!

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:43.800
Strike back, Dragon Master Knight!

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:51.530
Orichalcos Kyutora's effect activates!

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:56.780
I take no damage.

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:03.110
I get it!

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:08.660
He's raising Orichalcos Gigas’s attack points by having it attack!

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:13.900
Even if he keeps raising Orichalcos Gigas’s attack points...

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:18.100
...it’ll take a long time to exceed Dragon Master Knight's attack points.

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:23.800
It looked to me that he wanted that monster to absorb the attack.

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:29.010
Does it have another ability?

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.180
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:35.440
As long as he has that, attacking monsters won't work.

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:40.190
Orichalcos Gigas will gain attack points if I destroy it.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:43.190
It's a solid formation.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:48.130
But it’s not impossible to defeat you, Dartz!

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:51.880
I set a card!

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:55.370
Then I summon Blade Knight!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:06.300
When I have one or less cards in my hand, Blade Knight gains 400 attack points!

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:11.520
I end my turn.

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:13.880
So you're planning to do something, Kaiba.

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:16.390
Yugi, we only have one chance.

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:19.130
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:25.680
I activate this Quick-Play Spell by tributing one of my monsters!

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:28.000
Reflect Energy!

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:34.500
Yugi!  Now!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:38.280
Have Dragon Master Knight’s attack that!

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:42.830
Reflect Energy lets you attack him directly!

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:45.790
It's in Orichalcos Kyutora’s blind spot!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:48.220
Kaiba...  Here I go, Dartz!

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:51.480
Dragon Master Knight attacks!

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:54.200
Galaxy Crusher!

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:00.700
All right!

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:03.170
A direct attack with 5000 attack points!

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:04.610
This will end it!

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:08.240
What?

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:18.620
The second Seal of Orichalcos…

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:22.020
Orichalcos Deuteros’s second effect:

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:28.400
By tributing a monster, it negates your attack.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:33.580
And the attacking monster is destroyed.

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:39.370
Dragon Master Knight takes the attack!

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.350
Yugi!

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:46.510
Big brother!

00:16:46.510 --> 00:16:49.690
The Quick-Play Spell, De-Fusion!

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:53.860
You dodged it just in time.

00:16:55.020 --> 00:17:00.190
The second Seal won't let us attack him directly.

00:17:00.190 --> 00:17:05.170
But we still have the strongest monster on our field.

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:07.000
Are you sure?

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:07.710
What?

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:12.840
I know everything, including human weakness and hopelessness.

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:15.600
And you're no exception.

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:19.070
The biggest weakness is you yourself!

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:21.580
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:24.590
I activate the Ritual Spell, Orichalcos Mirror!

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:32.010
I tribute Timeater from my hand to Special Summon Mirror Knight Calling from my deck.

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:38.780
Due to Mirror Knight Calling's effect, I Special Summon Mirror Knights on my field.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.200
Four new monsters at once!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:46.120
I now have six monsters on my field.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:52.220
Due to Orichalcos Deuteros's effect, I regain 3000 life points.

00:17:52.220 --> 00:17:53.440
No way!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:59.040
500 attack points?

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:02.890
It’s due to The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:06.890
I told you that you're your biggest weakness.

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:08.460
You don't mean...

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:14.640
Yes.  Mirror Knight’s attack points are determined by the monster it battles.

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:33.840
Yugi!

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.570
Something's not right!

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:38.800
If their attack points are equal, his monsters should be destroyed too!

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.540
It's those shields!

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:50.540
Yes.  As long as they have their mirror shields, Mirror Knight isn't destroyed.

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:56.540
And as long as I have Mirror Knight Calling, the mirror shields regenerate.

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:59.280
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:02.550
I activate the spell card, Card of Demise!

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:07.060
It lets me draw five new cards from my deck!

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:12.240
But in return, I send my entire hand to the graveyard five turns later.

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:15.800
I activate Silent Doom from my hand!

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:18.770
I summon a monster from my graveyard in defense position!

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:21.950
Resurrect, Blade Knight!

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:27.950
I tribute Blade Knight to summon Kaiser Glider!

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:33.530
I set a card and end my turn!

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:40.280
Kaiser Glider can't be destroyed by monsters with equal attack points.

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:42.190
That's good thinking.

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:47.880
His monsters have the same attack points as ours.

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:50.800
We can’t be careless.

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:52.700
My turn!  I draw!

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:55.900
Mirror Force...

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:57.340
With this...

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:00.340
I set a card!

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:04.900
Then I summon Big Shield Gardna in defense position!

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:05.850
I end my turn!

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.850
My turn.  I draw!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:14.360
Due to Orichalcos Deuteros's effect, I regain 3000 life points.

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:17.290
He has over 10,000 life points.

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:24.060
But Dartz, the next time you attack, all your monsters will be destroyed.

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:28.080
I now activate my trap card!

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:34.070
If I destroy Mirror Knight Calling, Mirror Knight won't be invincible anymore!

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:36.010
Go, Ring of Destruction!

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:00.680
What?

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:09.410
Partner?

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:15.090
Jonouchi?

00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:16.940
Mai and Pegasus!

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:27.600
If I activated Mirror Force, they would've been...

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:35.470
You've forgotten that I control the souls I've captured.

00:21:59.270 --> 00:22:08.150
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:16.520
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:27.680
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:37.170
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:37.770 --> 00:22:46.230
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:47.010 --> 00:22:51.740
I'll live feeling them

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:56.890
For me to be me

00:22:56.890 --> 00:23:05.380
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:06.060 --> 00:23:11.020
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:11.540 --> 00:23:20.680
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:33.900
The four Mirror Knights that Dartz summoned are the souls of our friends!

00:23:33.900 --> 00:23:36.320
That's despicable, Dartz!

00:23:36.320 --> 00:23:39.600
The other Yugi can't attack!

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:42.580
Kaiba is cold-hearted, so he tries to attack.

00:23:42.580 --> 00:23:45.470
But the Mirror Knights' teamwork stops him.

00:23:45.470 --> 00:23:48.690
Is there any way to escape this pinch?

00:23:48.690 --> 00:23:51.380
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Captured Mirror Knights

00:23:51.380 --> 00:23:53.000
Duel, standby!
